    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_argument" kindref="compound">Argument</ref> promotion pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This pass walks the functions in each SCC and for each one tries to transform it and all of its callers to replace indirect arguments with direct (by-value) arguments. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
